{"key": "d96e9e06eb9bb89b722671e3f04e8bc9", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Crediário lets your customer split a purchase into up to 48 installments on a credit card [1][3]. The actual limit is set by each card issuer under its own credit policies [2]. Interest rates can also vary by issuer [1].\n\nTo see the interest for a specific purchase, run a simulation on the terminal. Insert the card, enter the amount, then choose credit > crediário. You can also print the simulation receipt if the terminal has paper [2]. The simulation is for reference only, and the issuer decides whether to approve the transaction [2].", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbQFPHyT8Er58z6UmCj", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2328}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2328, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3126, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 174, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
